      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Exponentiate: \\( |y| = \\frac{1}{2} e^{- 2 x^{2}} \\). Since \\( f(0) > 0 \\) and the solution is never 0, \\( y = \\frac{e^{- 2 x^{2}}}{2} \\).",
